(921286, 106502, 26542, '<td valign="top">This image really stood out for me in this challenge.  A beautiful shot and very well executed.  The greyscale is excellent and the lighting is just glorious.  The expression on the little guy/gals face is priceless. And the pose...the babies small and fragile frame cradled in that big masculine hand.  It is a very vivid representation of security...and that baby certainly feels secure there.<br/> <br/>I truly can''t find a negative thing to say about this picture.  I only hope you make this available as a print as I will certainly purchase one.  <br/> <br/>Beautiful image.  I sincerely hope you place very well in this challenge.  You certainly deserve to with this sample.</td>', 'This image really stood out for me in this challenge.  A beautiful shot and very well executed.  The greyscale is excellent and the lighting is just glorious.  The expression on the little guy/gals face is priceless. And the pose...the babies small and fragile frame cradled in that big masculine hand.  It is a very vivid representation of security...and that baby certainly feels secure there. I truly can''t find a negative thing to say about this picture.  I only hope you make this available as a print as I will certainly purchase one.   Beautiful image.  I sincerely hope you place very well in this challenge.  You certainly deserve to with this sample.', '2004-09-22 11:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
