(922015, 105728, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely simplicity and contrast of textures!  Some of the highlights are a bit bright.  The dirt on the nose is unfortunate, but had this been a member challenge I''m sure you would have cloned it out.  What an expression on the baby!  Nice capture!</td>', 'Lovely simplicity and contrast of textures!  Some of the highlights are a bit bright.  The dirt on the nose is unfortunate, but had this been a member challenge I''m sure you would have cloned it out.  What an expression on the baby!  Nice capture!', '2004-09-22 18:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(922016, 106144, 1827, '<td valign="top">Everything in this photo draws my eyes away from the life.  The choice of chair, the distracting shadows, the starkness of the bare breasts, the seeming discomfort in the shoulders, the decapitated mother, the hands covering too much.  Ack, life is the LAST thing I thnk in this photo; sorry. 5</td>', 'Everything in this photo draws my eyes away from the life.  The choice of chair, the distracting shadows, the starkness of the bare breasts, the seeming discomfort in the shoulders, the decapitated mother, the hands covering too much.  Ack, life is the LAST thing I thnk in this photo; sorry. 5', '2004-09-22 18:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(922018, 106117, 18828, '<td valign="top">nice picture.  i think it would be better if you had removed the frame and other things that are cut off on the left side.  also, i think it would be better if you had taken it in front of a cleaner uncluttered background (like a bedsheet or something) so that it doesn''t take away from the image.  or maybe if you could have brought the chair closer and possibly blurred out the background or something.</td>', 'nice picture.  i think it would be better if you had removed the frame and other things that are cut off on the left side.  also, i think it would be better if you had taken it in front of a cleaner uncluttered background (like a bedsheet or something) so that it doesn''t take away from the image.  or maybe if you could have brought the chair closer and possibly blurred out the background or something.', '2004-09-22 18:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
