(922025, 106710, 18828, '<td valign="top">i think the composition of this picture doesn''t really draw the eye to anything in particular.  it also seems that some of the things are there just to be there, but don''t really add anything to the image.  it seems a little dark and dull.  since it''s a color photo, maybe some color in the bottles or something would have helped.  also, maybe a change in lighting could help bring focus to something.</td>', 'i think the composition of this picture doesn''t really draw the eye to anything in particular.  it also seems that some of the things are there just to be there, but don''t really add anything to the image.  it seems a little dark and dull.  since it''s a color photo, maybe some color in the bottles or something would have helped.  also, maybe a change in lighting could help bring focus to something.', '2004-09-22 18:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(922027, 106682, 18828, '<td valign="top">nice picture.  i think maybe it would be better if you had cropped a little bit of the black at the bottom.  it just seems that it would look better that way, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'nice picture.  i think maybe it would be better if you had cropped a little bit of the black at the bottom.  it just seems that it would look better that way, but that''s just my opinion.', '2004-09-22 18:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(922028, 106373, 22748, '<td valign="top">The lighting is the main problem here. It looks like an on-camera flash from the shadows casted and the flatness and harshness of the lighting.</td>', 'The lighting is the main problem here. It looks like an on-camera flash from the shadows casted and the flatness and harshness of the lighting.', '2004-09-22 18:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(922034, 106911, 25867, '<td valign="top">I think I can feel that sand!</td>', 'I think I can feel that sand!', '2004-09-22 18:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(922037, 106655, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, good undistracting background. <br/> <br/>Hmmmm, on second thought, is that background the GRADIENT thing mentioned in the forum thread that got all controversial about EddyG''s smoke image? I think so...<br/> <br/>While looked nice at first glance, it began to look unnatural after gazing at it for a minute, especially around the hand, because of the darkness of the edges of the hand in contrast to the light background. <br/> <br/>Mostly just a weird transition, but also the lighting on the hand is flat, and the flowers are casting shadows characteristic of an ON-CAMERA FLASH. I wish people wouldn''t use the builtin flashes for their challenge submissions. They just don''t make the colors and textures good.<br/> <br/>I will say that the background IS very well separated from the foreground. Clearly a careful job of separation there, so some points for that.</td>', 'Nice lines, good undistracting background.  Hmmmm, on second thought, is that background the GRADIENT thing mentioned in the forum thread that got all controversial about EddyG''s smoke image? I think so... While looked nice at first glance, it began to look unnatural after gazing at it for a minute, especially around the hand, because of the darkness of the edges of the hand in contrast to the light background.  Mostly just a weird transition, but also the lighting on the hand is flat, and the flowers are casting shadows characteristic of an ON-CAMERA FLASH. I wish people wouldn''t use the builtin flashes for their challenge submissions. They just don''t make the colors and textures good. I will say that the background IS very well separated from the foreground. Clearly a careful job of separation there, so some points for that.', '2004-09-22 18:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(922038, 106093, 22748, '<td valign="top">While it *is* a bit grainy, the colors are great, and the arm draws the eye into the picture. I like it.</td>', 'While it *is* a bit grainy, the colors are great, and the arm draws the eye into the picture. I like it.', '2004-09-22 18:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
