(922461, 106673, 25218, '<td valign="top">I''m stunned. This is the first photo to come up for voting, and I''m blown away. You Perfect use of lighting - it''s like he''s being pulled from the darkness. The colors are clear &amp; effective. His expression and her calming hand is very touching. In the whole "tactile vs. emotion" debate going on in the forum I was leaning toward tactile, but this has opened my eyes that it doesn''t have to be one or the other. Great photo!</td>', 'I''m stunned. This is the first photo to come up for voting, and I''m blown away. You Perfect use of lighting - it''s like he''s being pulled from the darkness. The colors are clear & effective. His expression and her calming hand is very touching. In the whole "tactile vs. emotion" debate going on in the forum I was leaning toward tactile, but this has opened my eyes that it doesn''t have to be one or the other. Great photo!', '2004-09-22 22:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
