(922694, 106966, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good pun for the challenge, with several uses of touch.  I like the composition, though perhaps I would have preferred more of the hand (to the wrist), and less of a "clutch" pose-touch tone dialing would have been better IMHO.  Also, this seems a bit too dark to me (especially by the phone).  (By the way, as an international site, some people may not get the AT&amp;T advertisement title.).</td>', 'A good pun for the challenge, with several uses of touch.  I like the composition, though perhaps I would have preferred more of the hand (to the wrist), and less of a "clutch" pose-touch tone dialing would have been better IMHO.  Also, this seems a bit too dark to me (especially by the phone).  (By the way, as an international site, some people may not get the AT&T advertisement title.).', '2004-09-23 00:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
