(922894, 106894, 25921, '<td valign="top">I think this image would have had more impact with more of the hand showing.  I like the cropping though, I just imagine an extra 1" or 1 1/2" on the bottom showing the rest of the hand would do wonders.  Nice moment.</td>', 'I think this image would have had more impact with more of the hand showing.  I like the cropping though, I just imagine an extra 1" or 1 1/2" on the bottom showing the rest of the hand would do wonders.  Nice moment.', '2004-09-23 04:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
