(923021, 106824, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is well done.  I would suggest small adjustments in the positioning of the heads (I think they should be parrallel for maximum effect) and an equal crop (perhaps right down the deas center of the noses?)  But the idea is fantastic, and the color match/exposure is great.  Overall, very nicely done.</td>', 'This is well done.  I would suggest small adjustments in the positioning of the heads (I think they should be parrallel for maximum effect) and an equal crop (perhaps right down the deas center of the noses?)  But the idea is fantastic, and the color match/exposure is great.  Overall, very nicely done.', '2004-09-23 08:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(923039, 106612, 27075, '<td valign="top">Nice model.</td>', 'Nice model.', '2004-09-23 08:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(923067, 105561, 27107, '<td valign="top">Too cute! I so want that dog!! I can feel the soft fur, so cuddly! What kind of dog is that I wonder.</td>', 'Too cute! I so want that dog!! I can feel the soft fur, so cuddly! What kind of dog is that I wonder.', '2004-09-23 09:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(923072, 106823, 25397, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering how you got those colors without disobeying the rules...It''s Obvious you just cloned it in.</td>', 'I''m wondering how you got those colors without disobeying the rules...It''s Obvious you just cloned it in.', '2004-09-23 09:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(923093, 106785, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the light on the hand, but am wondering if a light source on the front of the blocks would have been effective, too.  I also found the scratched table top distracting -- perhaps a solid color paper underneath would be an idea.  I like the warm colors of the photo.</td>', 'I like the light on the hand, but am wondering if a light source on the front of the blocks would have been effective, too.  I also found the scratched table top distracting -- perhaps a solid color paper underneath would be an idea.  I like the warm colors of the photo.', '2004-09-23 09:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(923096, 105615, 24065, '<td valign="top">This was a great idea.  I think it might be improved with better lighting, stronger focus, and a flat background.</td>', 'This was a great idea.  I think it might be improved with better lighting, stronger focus, and a flat background.', '2004-09-23 09:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(923100, 105548, 24065, '<td valign="top">The cat''s pose is great.  I think another location for the photo would have been better -- too much going on in this one.  Also, the flash on the camera has caused some harsh shadows.  Perhaps another light source and using the flash only for fill.</td>', 'The cat''s pose is great.  I think another location for the photo would have been better -- too much going on in this one.  Also, the flash on the camera has caused some harsh shadows.  Perhaps another light source and using the flash only for fill.', '2004-09-23 09:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(923101, 105514, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  My only suggestion for improvement would be to move to a location with less a less distracting background.</td>', 'Great idea.  My only suggestion for improvement would be to move to a location with less a less distracting background.', '2004-09-23 09:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(923102, 106951, 24065, '<td valign="top">I''m very new at photography, but I think a fill flash and less distracting background would have improved the photo.  The clouds behind are great -- it''s just all the other stuff that pulls my eyes away from the main subject.</td>', 'I''m very new at photography, but I think a fill flash and less distracting background would have improved the photo.  The clouds behind are great -- it''s just all the other stuff that pulls my eyes away from the main subject.', '2004-09-23 09:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(923105, 106117, 24065, '<td valign="top">The boy''s pose and expression is very nice.  The background and shirt detract from the main subject.</td>', 'The boy''s pose and expression is very nice.  The background and shirt detract from the main subject.', '2004-09-23 09:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(923109, 105715, 24065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea for the subject.  The photo appears rather dark.</td>', 'I like the idea for the subject.  The photo appears rather dark.', '2004-09-23 09:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(923110, 106774, 26115, '<td valign="top">gr8 idea! its rather unfortunate that there is not alot of detail though, possibly look at creating a clearer focus for that added appeal</td>', 'gr8 idea! its rather unfortunate that there is not alot of detail though, possibly look at creating a clearer focus for that added appeal', '2004-09-23 09:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
