(923476, 106371, 12448, '<td valign="top">The bee almost gets lost in the center of the flower.  Nice capture but a bit bright overall and almost over sharp, the sense I get from this flower is that it would hurt to touch it, not because of the reference to the sun (fire colored petals) but it would cut my finger or something.  So many flowers in the challenge and I''m not really making the connection to the challenge and therefore voting them lower.  Sorry, a 2</td>', 'The bee almost gets lost in the center of the flower.  Nice capture but a bit bright overall and almost over sharp, the sense I get from this flower is that it would hurt to touch it, not because of the reference to the sun (fire colored petals) but it would cut my finger or something.  So many flowers in the challenge and I''m not really making the connection to the challenge and therefore voting them lower.  Sorry, a 2', '2004-09-23 14:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(923479, 106838, 12448, '<td valign="top">This had potential, with all the flower shots this one had a shot because of the title.  But then when I pulled it up, it was out of focus (doesn''t come off as a soft focus) and the colors seem off for some reason.  I''ve never seen a flower that color and I visit greenhouses all summer with my clients.  The stuff on the right of the shot is distracting, maybe a tighter crop on that side?  As is a 3</td>', 'This had potential, with all the flower shots this one had a shot because of the title.  But then when I pulled it up, it was out of focus (doesn''t come off as a soft focus) and the colors seem off for some reason.  I''ve never seen a flower that color and I visit greenhouses all summer with my clients.  The stuff on the right of the shot is distracting, maybe a tighter crop on that side?  As is a 3', '2004-09-23 14:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(923481, 106333, 12448, '<td valign="top">A lovely flower shot but I"m going to tell you what I told the others, I don''t get the connection.  I don''t feel the subject per say and really don''t think they belong in this challenge, maybe if Marie was stroking the flower against her cheek or something but sorry, a 2</td>', 'A lovely flower shot but I"m going to tell you what I told the others, I don''t get the connection.  I don''t feel the subject per say and really don''t think they belong in this challenge, maybe if Marie was stroking the flower against her cheek or something but sorry, a 2', '2004-09-23 14:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(923482, 106812, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a great snapshot of a candid moment but the flash and lack of focus overall really hurts the shot.  A little more post processing to lessen the effect of the flash might help quite a bit.  As is a 3</td>', 'This is a great snapshot of a candid moment but the flash and lack of focus overall really hurts the shot.  A little more post processing to lessen the effect of the flash might help quite a bit.  As is a 3', '2004-09-23 14:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(923484, 106751, 12448, '<td valign="top">At least they are touching each other.  But all the flower shots in this challenge really throw me.  I don''t really understand how they fit the challenge.  But that''s me and I''m sure after the challenge we can discuss it in the forums.  It''s not a bad shot composition wise, I like the way ti''s set up and the contrasting colors but the focus seems a bit off and the stone in the lower right corner seem to throw the balance off just a touch.  All the flower shots are getting lower scores from me, sorry, a 2</td>', 'At least they are touching each other.  But all the flower shots in this challenge really throw me.  I don''t really understand how they fit the challenge.  But that''s me and I''m sure after the challenge we can discuss it in the forums.  It''s not a bad shot composition wise, I like the way ti''s set up and the contrasting colors but the focus seems a bit off and the stone in the lower right corner seem to throw the balance off just a touch.  All the flower shots are getting lower scores from me, sorry, a 2', '2004-09-23 14:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(923487, 106504, 12448, '<td valign="top">This had potential until the post processing.  The flash and resulting shadows and then the adjustments made afterwards just ruined the shot for me.  Too bright, to contrasting and bad shadows.  A 2</td>', 'This had potential until the post processing.  The flash and resulting shadows and then the adjustments made afterwards just ruined the shot for me.  Too bright, to contrasting and bad shadows.  A 2', '2004-09-23 14:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(923488, 106555, 26025, '<td valign="top">Love the saturation, yet it''s slightly too centered. you should have left more space on the right handsite. It is definetelly the touch :)</td>', 'Love the saturation, yet it''s slightly too centered. you should have left more space on the right handsite. It is definetelly the touch :)', '2004-09-23 14:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(923490, 106283, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, original, that''s for sure but the shot leaves me wanting.  The lack of focus, the grain and the coloration just don''t quite work for me on this shot.  A 2</td>', 'A nice idea, original, that''s for sure but the shot leaves me wanting.  The lack of focus, the grain and the coloration just don''t quite work for me on this shot.  A 2', '2004-09-23 14:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(923493, 106950, 26025, '<td valign="top">The idea is great, but the photo lacks sharpness in my oppinion...</td>', 'The idea is great, but the photo lacks sharpness in my oppinion...', '2004-09-23 14:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(923497, 106926, 26025, '<td valign="top">Nice, yet that tiny ring destract my attention.. ;) I would like to see a bit more of a finger (the one in the center).</td>', 'Nice, yet that tiny ring destract my attention.. ;) I would like to see a bit more of a finger (the one in the center).', '2004-09-23 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
