(923519, 106653, 8624, '<td valign="top">I assume the big blurry thing is your finger trying to touch the moon. It doesn''t really come across that way without the aid of the title. This image is certainly a challenge for creating deep depth of field. It might have wrked better to have had your hand much further away from the lens and then cropped the image down.</td>', 'I assume the big blurry thing is your finger trying to touch the moon. It doesn''t really come across that way without the aid of the title. This image is certainly a challenge for creating deep depth of field. It might have wrked better to have had your hand much further away from the lens and then cropped the image down.', '2004-09-23 15:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(923520, 106864, 8624, '<td valign="top">great concept. nice lighting, although the shadows are a bit harsh. I think this might have also been a little cleaner had the woman''s hand not had nail polish on the fingers.</td>', 'great concept. nice lighting, although the shadows are a bit harsh. I think this might have also been a little cleaner had the woman''s hand not had nail polish on the fingers.', '2004-09-23 15:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(923523, 106827, 8624, '<td valign="top">a very sweet image. I like the gentleness expressed by the older sibling''s hand on the back of the younger child. I don''t care for the color cast in this image, however. Simple black and white might have been more effective.</td>', 'a very sweet image. I like the gentleness expressed by the older sibling''s hand on the back of the younger child. I don''t care for the color cast in this image, however. Simple black and white might have been more effective.', '2004-09-23 15:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(923529, 106764, 26718, '<td valign="top">I love your pictures they are quite humorous.  Why the wood people?  Nice, I like the black backround!!  Theres some funk in that bottom left corner again, speckles and blue cloth, I''m sure your aware of that.  I think that it would have looked a bit more dramatic with a tighter crop, you would lose the print size but it would have gotten rid of the left corner distractions.</td>', 'I love your pictures they are quite humorous.  Why the wood people?  Nice, I like the black backround!!  Theres some funk in that bottom left corner again, speckles and blue cloth, I''m sure your aware of that.  I think that it would have looked a bit more dramatic with a tighter crop, you would lose the print size but it would have gotten rid of the left corner distractions.', '2004-09-23 15:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(923533, 106601, 26718, '<td valign="top">That''s grea, very funny.  I wish I could see both of your elbows.</td>', 'That''s grea, very funny.  I wish I could see both of your elbows.', '2004-09-23 15:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(923537, 106080, 26025, '<td valign="top">sligthly overexposed and a bit too centered.</td>', 'sligthly overexposed and a bit too centered.', '2004-09-23 15:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(923545, 106114, 4008, '<td valign="top">very good, up close and personal, great fit to the challenge. I think some light in the eyes would have made it perfect. 9</td>', 'very good, up close and personal, great fit to the challenge. I think some light in the eyes would have made it perfect. 9', '2004-09-23 15:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(923547, 106730, 26718, '<td valign="top">&lt;AWSOME&gt; Have to say that I''ve never seen nor heard of oen of these, looks great.  I can feel it.  Just wondering what the greenish blue haze is at the bottom of the fruit, also did you try a tighter crop, the wood is pretty but distracts from the spikes on the far right and left sides.</td>', '<AWSOME> Have to say that I''ve never seen nor heard of oen of these, looks great.  I can feel it.  Just wondering what the greenish blue haze is at the bottom of the fruit, also did you try a tighter crop, the wood is pretty but distracts from the spikes on the far right and left sides.', '2004-09-23 15:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(923550, 106598, 4008, '<td valign="top">great image but can''t see the touch theme in it.</td>', 'great image but can''t see the touch theme in it.', '2004-09-23 15:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
