(923825, 106823, 24065, '<td valign="top">I have struggled more over rating this photograph than any other in the challenge.  I understand your intent and am a Christian, so I like your subject matter.  So, even tho I personally don''t think it meets the challenge, I''m willing to be open minded about how you interpreted it.  The colors are bothering me a great deal.  I see the bright green before I see the church.  There also appears to be some pixel problems (artifacting?) right around the edge of the church.  My eyes are drawn to that, too.  So... I am not giving a low score, but would have given a higher one if it had not been for these issues.</td>', 'I have struggled more over rating this photograph than any other in the challenge.  I understand your intent and am a Christian, so I like your subject matter.  So, even tho I personally don''t think it meets the challenge, I''m willing to be open minded about how you interpreted it.  The colors are bothering me a great deal.  I see the bright green before I see the church.  There also appears to be some pixel problems (artifacting?) right around the edge of the church.  My eyes are drawn to that, too.  So... I am not giving a low score, but would have given a higher one if it had not been for these issues.', '2004-09-23 18:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
