(924132, 106246, 24642, '<td valign="top">Original composition.  Lacks balance in color imo. Maybe some visible background on the right would help?</td>', 'Original composition.  Lacks balance in color imo. Maybe some visible background on the right would help?', '2004-09-23 22:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
