(924219, 106922, 8624, '<td valign="top">I really like the textures in the wood sphere. It definitely makes me want to run my hand over it. I don''t really care for the red fabric upon which it is resting. The seam is distracting and the bottom right seems blown out and oversaturated.</td>', 'I really like the textures in the wood sphere. It definitely makes me want to run my hand over it. I don''t really care for the red fabric upon which it is resting. The seam is distracting and the bottom right seems blown out and oversaturated.', '2004-09-23 23:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(924221, 106329, 8624, '<td valign="top">excellent! I love the layout of the dominos - the spiral is very eye catching and I love the hand ready to flick the first one and start  the tumbling action. Your lighting is perfect and the composition overall very pleasing. my favorite so far!</td>', 'excellent! I love the layout of the dominos - the spiral is very eye catching and I love the hand ready to flick the first one and start  the tumbling action. Your lighting is perfect and the composition overall very pleasing. my favorite so far!', '2004-09-23 23:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(924222, 105940, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the action and interplay between the two dancers. I wish the guy''s eyes wern''t closed, however.</td>', 'I like the action and interplay between the two dancers. I wish the guy''s eyes wern''t closed, however.', '2004-09-23 23:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(924226, 106161, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautifully lit. the color of the flowers is very vibrant.  something about not seeing the thumb in the frame looks weird to me, but it is not a major distraction in the shot. overall very nice.</td>', 'beautifully lit. the color of the flowers is very vibrant.  something about not seeing the thumb in the frame looks weird to me, but it is not a major distraction in the shot. overall very nice.', '2004-09-23 23:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
