(924236, 106783, 12583, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Pretty feather, pretty skin, nice shot. I like the warm colors in the background too.</td>', 'Very nice. Pretty feather, pretty skin, nice shot. I like the warm colors in the background too.', '2004-09-23 23:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
