(924240, 106778, 8624, '<td valign="top">nicely done as a black and white image. had this been an advanced editting challenge, I would have recommended removing the baby''s hand in the top corner of the frame because I think the mother cradling the feet is really a strong image and doesn''t need the competiton. I also think the frame border competes for my attention. It''s a great image. Let it stand on its own without the extraneous elements.</td>', 'nicely done as a black and white image. had this been an advanced editting challenge, I would have recommended removing the baby''s hand in the top corner of the frame because I think the mother cradling the feet is really a strong image and doesn''t need the competiton. I also think the frame border competes for my attention. It''s a great image. Let it stand on its own without the extraneous elements.', '2004-09-23 23:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(924242, 105812, 8624, '<td valign="top">this could have been a pretty cool image. I like the composition but the soft focus, over sharpening and weird color artificats damage it severely.</td>', 'this could have been a pretty cool image. I like the composition but the soft focus, over sharpening and weird color artificats damage it severely.', '2004-09-24 00:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
