(924936, 106356, 3102, '<td valign="top">A potentially cute shot, but it''s a bit snapshot-ish for a submission, I''m afraid.  It''s not well-composed with all of the space above their heads, not to mention the giant lego stuck in the couch.  If this had been cropped just above the heads, it would have been a pretty decent shot!</td>', 'A potentially cute shot, but it''s a bit snapshot-ish for a submission, I''m afraid.  It''s not well-composed with all of the space above their heads, not to mention the giant lego stuck in the couch.  If this had been cropped just above the heads, it would have been a pretty decent shot!', '2004-09-24 15:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(924938, 106823, 3102, '<td valign="top">A really cool shot... but also quite weak on the challenge...</td>', 'A really cool shot... but also quite weak on the challenge...', '2004-09-24 15:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(924942, 106298, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great representation of the challenge!  I feel like I should wash my hands just from *looking* at this!  One of my few 10s this time around.  Awesome lighting!</td>', 'Great representation of the challenge!  I feel like I should wash my hands just from *looking* at this!  One of my few 10s this time around.  Awesome lighting!', '2004-09-24 15:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(924943, 106778, 3102, '<td valign="top">A simple enough topic, but you tackled it tremendously well!  I like the way you did this without any distractions in the background, and the skin tones are supurb.  A 10 from me!</td>', 'A simple enough topic, but you tackled it tremendously well!  I like the way you did this without any distractions in the background, and the skin tones are supurb.  A 10 from me!', '2004-09-24 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(924952, 106001, 23921, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.</td>', 'I like the concept.', '2004-09-24 15:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(924953, 106713, 19608, '<td valign="top">OK - here''s the good news and the bad news.  Good -  It''s a great study in texture with a perfect background. The colors are well mixed with a background that makes both the texture and the color stand out.  Focus is nicely done.  Bad:  The composition is "ok" but the horn right on the border drawsy your eye up and out of the frame.  It would be far better if you could see more of the eye and especially if the eye had a catchlight. The three white small highlights inside the eye are a bit unfortunate.  Bottom line: Does it make me want to touch it?  Is the study of texture strong enough to make me "feel" it?  YES - but it''s not my most favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'OK - here''s the good news and the bad news.  Good -  It''s a great study in texture with a perfect background. The colors are well mixed with a background that makes both the texture and the color stand out.  Focus is nicely done.  Bad:  The composition is "ok" but the horn right on the border drawsy your eye up and out of the frame.  It would be far better if you could see more of the eye and especially if the eye had a catchlight. The three white small highlights inside the eye are a bit unfortunate.  Bottom line: Does it make me want to touch it?  Is the study of texture strong enough to make me "feel" it?  YES - but it''s not my most favorite of the challenge.', '2004-09-24 15:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(924954, 105742, 19608, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft pastel blurry background.  Nice exposure works well.  The image doesn''t shout touch - it barely whispers.</td>', 'I really like the soft pastel blurry background.  Nice exposure works well.  The image doesn''t shout touch - it barely whispers.', '2004-09-24 15:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(924955, 106944, 23921, '<td valign="top">Picture is good, but where is ''Mother''?....(know that the bottom), but hard to see it, and the picture size is too big to fit on the screen and see and feel the mother''s hand.</td>', 'Picture is good, but where is ''Mother''?....(know that the bottom), but hard to see it, and the picture size is too big to fit on the screen and see and feel the mother''s hand.', '2004-09-24 15:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(924991, 106967, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a learning experience - good find.  Everything works, but I wish the mom''s face didn''t cover the child''s head quite so much.  Colors are great with the b&amp;w background.</td>', 'What a learning experience - good find.  Everything works, but I wish the mom''s face didn''t cover the child''s head quite so much.  Colors are great with the b&w background.', '2004-09-24 16:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(924998, 106954, 19608, '<td valign="top">Touch hell - I want to take a bite!  Nice job, perfect texture is evident.  It goes well with the gray and white setting, but would be a bit stronger if the stem had retained a bit more green.</td>', 'Touch hell - I want to take a bite!  Nice job, perfect texture is evident.  It goes well with the gray and white setting, but would be a bit stronger if the stem had retained a bit more green.', '2004-09-24 16:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(925001, 106844, 16301, '<td valign="top">I wish I was in Asia Manny. Excellent! (10)<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'I wish I was in Asia Manny. Excellent! (10) Good luck...', '2004-09-24 16:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(925026, 105554, 23338, '<td valign="top">This just really is so out of focus that I can''t get past that part.   If it were in focus, and demonstrating touch - maybe I could buy it.  But, even then it would probably be a so-so subject from my viewpoint.  But, who am I to criticize - I didn''t even enter this challenge.  Good luck with it.</td>', 'This just really is so out of focus that I can''t get past that part.   If it were in focus, and demonstrating touch - maybe I could buy it.  But, even then it would probably be a so-so subject from my viewpoint.  But, who am I to criticize - I didn''t even enter this challenge.  Good luck with it.', '2004-09-24 17:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(925027, 106531, 23338, '<td valign="top">I''ll probably be dumbfounded when this challenge is all over and I understand what great insight you have to the subject of "touch", but right now, with no explanation, I''m just lost.  I have no idea what I''m looking at.  I CAN see, from the object close to the left foreground, that there "might" be frost on it - and thus the title.  But, that''s as close as I can get to an understanding.  Good luck with the other raters.</td>', 'I''ll probably be dumbfounded when this challenge is all over and I understand what great insight you have to the subject of "touch", but right now, with no explanation, I''m just lost.  I have no idea what I''m looking at.  I CAN see, from the object close to the left foreground, that there "might" be frost on it - and thus the title.  But, that''s as close as I can get to an understanding.  Good luck with the other raters.', '2004-09-24 17:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(925031, 106764, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, good detail, contrast and color.  Is that a kleenex the dummy is holding?  You take a nice image, why not take it of something other than dummies?   You also need slightly better lighting on that bear''s foot; I think I just figured out that it says, "Softest", which would be a reference to the kleenex or toilet paper?  Ok, I''ll leave it at 4, but I wanted to give the dummy a 3.  (Hate those dummies...)</td>', 'Nice lighting, good detail, contrast and color.  Is that a kleenex the dummy is holding?  You take a nice image, why not take it of something other than dummies?   You also need slightly better lighting on that bear''s foot; I think I just figured out that it says, "Softest", which would be a reference to the kleenex or toilet paper?  Ok, I''ll leave it at 4, but I wanted to give the dummy a 3.  (Hate those dummies...)', '2004-09-24 17:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(925035, 105930, 23338, '<td valign="top">I know, it''s a cheap trick.  Done it myself at Spencer''s Gifts many times.  But, I still like the image - and it does conjure up feelings of "touch".  And it''s fun looking at all the lighting effects created by it and then captured by the camera.  So, for pure entertainment value, and because the overall image is so well balanced, you get a higher score from me.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I know, it''s a cheap trick.  Done it myself at Spencer''s Gifts many times.  But, I still like the image - and it does conjure up feelings of "touch".  And it''s fun looking at all the lighting effects created by it and then captured by the camera.  So, for pure entertainment value, and because the overall image is so well balanced, you get a higher score from me.  Congratulations and good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-24 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(925038, 106714, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is just so creative.  My first impression is Christmas (green and red).  Then, when I get looking closer, it''s almost madness - ripping, tearing thorns being squeezed by real fingers depicted in an almost Infra-red and negative fashion.  The result is very ghostly, unreal and scary.  But, fascinating to study.  Great image.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This is just so creative.  My first impression is Christmas (green and red).  Then, when I get looking closer, it''s almost madness - ripping, tearing thorns being squeezed by real fingers depicted in an almost Infra-red and negative fashion.  The result is very ghostly, unreal and scary.  But, fascinating to study.  Great image.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-24 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(925039, 106940, 25218, '<td valign="top">very soulful eyes. Nice picture!</td>', 'very soulful eyes. Nice picture!', '2004-09-24 17:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(925040, 106198, 25218, '<td valign="top">Looks great - everything is in focus - good job!</td>', 'Looks great - everything is in focus - good job!', '2004-09-24 17:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(925041, 105796, 23338, '<td valign="top">Ok, I like black and white.  I like really close-up detail.  This gets an automatic 7 the first time around.  We''ll see if I raise it again after comparing it with all the other images for relative value to the challenge subject of Touch.</td>', 'Ok, I like black and white.  I like really close-up detail.  This gets an automatic 7 the first time around.  We''ll see if I raise it again after comparing it with all the other images for relative value to the challenge subject of Touch.', '2004-09-24 17:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(925043, 106901, 25218, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the photo - you really draw the eye through the photo. Good job!</td>', 'I like the composition of the photo - you really draw the eye through the photo. Good job!', '2004-09-24 17:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(925045, 106682, 23338, '<td valign="top">Really nice image.  Too much "dirt" in it.  Specifically the stuff hanging around in the air.  It that stuff exists because it came from the other similar objects on the surface being touched, well, in my opinion, it should still be cleaned up.  It detracts from the image.  Specifically the three dots above the finger.  At least, that''s my opinion.</td>', 'Really nice image.  Too much "dirt" in it.  Specifically the stuff hanging around in the air.  It that stuff exists because it came from the other similar objects on the surface being touched, well, in my opinion, it should still be cleaned up.  It detracts from the image.  Specifically the three dots above the finger.  At least, that''s my opinion.', '2004-09-24 17:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(925055, 106829, 23338, '<td valign="top">Ok, you get my 10.  Reason? The stark contrasts between beautifully lit and very realistic colors of the solid fingers versus the monotone blacks, grays and whites of the masses of obviously very soft feathers.   Neat composition.  Very striking image.  Really love it.  Has "touch" written all over it.  Different. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Ok, you get my 10.  Reason? The stark contrasts between beautifully lit and very realistic colors of the solid fingers versus the monotone blacks, grays and whites of the masses of obviously very soft feathers.   Neat composition.  Very striking image.  Really love it.  Has "touch" written all over it.  Different. Thanks for sharing.', '2004-09-24 18:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(925058, 106803, 23338, '<td valign="top">Come on, kid.  Grab a handful and yank!   :-)   Kids love to touch beards and faces and eyebrows and glasses.  It''s all about touch.  Brought back memories of when MY kids were young.  Your image nicely portrays just the essentials to get that feeling across.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Come on, kid.  Grab a handful and yank!   :-)   Kids love to touch beards and faces and eyebrows and glasses.  It''s all about touch.  Brought back memories of when MY kids were young.  Your image nicely portrays just the essentials to get that feeling across.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-24 18:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(925062, 106298, 23338, '<td valign="top">Eeewww, yuck!  What IS that crud?  Love the way you showed it, with the one eye looking through, all the stringy parts pulled taut, and the bright contrasts with dark background, including the effect of having the head floating behind everything (no neck showing).  The green/yellow/red colors at the top might have been less distracting if replaced by pure black, but, Hey!  That''s just me again.  Great image.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Eeewww, yuck!  What IS that crud?  Love the way you showed it, with the one eye looking through, all the stringy parts pulled taut, and the bright contrasts with dark background, including the effect of having the head floating behind everything (no neck showing).  The green/yellow/red colors at the top might have been less distracting if replaced by pure black, but, Hey!  That''s just me again.  Great image.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-24 18:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(925063, 105570, 24642, '<td valign="top">Fresh and lively. Those boys must be a lot of fun.</td>', 'Fresh and lively. Those boys must be a lot of fun.', '2004-09-24 18:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
