(925066, 106198, 23338, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s touch.  Little, wet bubbles and a childs fascination with them.  Nice capture of the moment.  Great focus on the eyes, facial features and some of the bubbles.  Hand appears a little soft (maybe was moving?), but overall, it really works.  Congratulations and good luck with the image.</td>', 'Yep, that''s touch.  Little, wet bubbles and a childs fascination with them.  Nice capture of the moment.  Great focus on the eyes, facial features and some of the bubbles.  Hand appears a little soft (maybe was moving?), but overall, it really works.  Congratulations and good luck with the image.', '2004-09-24 18:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
