(925116, 106298, 22011, '<td valign="top">Neat!  To me this almost looks like two phtos, the girls portrait, and someone elses hands with the sticky stuff on them in front...  I hope you got a photo of the girl without the stick stuff in front...  With this lighting it''d make a really nice ''moody'' portrait.  Capturing the eye looking through the threads of goop is great, and she is showing no emotion towards the sticky stuff..  There appears to be a bit of motion blur or out of focus on her left hand, but that''s only minor, on the whole  a great photo..  8 for me.</td>', 'Neat!  To me this almost looks like two phtos, the girls portrait, and someone elses hands with the sticky stuff on them in front...  I hope you got a photo of the girl without the stick stuff in front...  With this lighting it''d make a really nice ''moody'' portrait.  Capturing the eye looking through the threads of goop is great, and she is showing no emotion towards the sticky stuff..  There appears to be a bit of motion blur or out of focus on her left hand, but that''s only minor, on the whole  a great photo..  8 for me.', '2004-09-24 18:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(925117, 106170, 24183, '<td valign="top">One of the best I have seen</td>', 'One of the best I have seen', '2004-09-24 18:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(925120, 106104, 23338, '<td valign="top">I think I see the dog, and I possibly see the squirril, but, "Touch"?  Naw, don''t see it.   Maybe if you had looked longer you could find an Angel - "Touched by an Angel"?  Anyway, if you found one, I would have darked the sky slightly, increased the whites in the clouds, and given it a bit more contrast as a result.  Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I think I see the dog, and I possibly see the squirril, but, "Touch"?  Naw, don''t see it.   Maybe if you had looked longer you could find an Angel - "Touched by an Angel"?  Anyway, if you found one, I would have darked the sky slightly, increased the whites in the clouds, and given it a bit more contrast as a result.  Just my opinion.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-24 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
