(925665, 106824, 22011, '<td valign="top">What an interesting photo!  Your model looks almost evil, or maybe that isn''t the right word, but certainly far more serious than your average childs photo.  The contrast to the fake smile on the dolls face is stunning, the diagonal lines of the hands draw me in even more, and the tight crop is just right.  What a great photo..    I''ve come back to this about five times now...  The range of tones is great, lighting is bang on, the lack of catch lights in the girls eyes enhances the feeling...   back again.. :-)  changed to a 10</td>', 'What an interesting photo!  Your model looks almost evil, or maybe that isn''t the right word, but certainly far more serious than your average childs photo.  The contrast to the fake smile on the dolls face is stunning, the diagonal lines of the hands draw me in even more, and the tight crop is just right.  What a great photo..    I''ve come back to this about five times now...  The range of tones is great, lighting is bang on, the lack of catch lights in the girls eyes enhances the feeling...   back again.. :-)  changed to a 10', '2004-09-25 04:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
