(925796, 105965, 21083, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best of the challenge, what a great shot. Hope this is a ribbon winner !   :)</td>', 'This is one of the best of the challenge, what a great shot. Hope this is a ribbon winner !   :)', '2004-09-25 11:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
