(925913, 106864, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nail polish....hmmmm....just not what I think the almighty might have had in mind during this particular process....nice clarity and good composition but the nail polish just does not work for me.</td>', 'Nail polish....hmmmm....just not what I think the almighty might have had in mind during this particular process....nice clarity and good composition but the nail polish just does not work for me.', '2004-09-25 13:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(925917, 106778, 8891, '<td valign="top">The composition of the hands and feet are really great. I am distracted by the childs hand and arm in the top right and wish you had been able to shoot it without the in the frame. maybe a mini black, dark back drop over the childs torso would have done.</td>', 'The composition of the hands and feet are really great. I am distracted by the childs hand and arm in the top right and wish you had been able to shoot it without the in the frame. maybe a mini black, dark back drop over the childs torso would have done.', '2004-09-25 13:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(925918, 105768, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the more sublte of the self mutilation shots in this challenge. Great compostion and fine detail....thanks for minimalizing the gore. I appreciate it!</td>', 'I think this is one of the more sublte of the self mutilation shots in this challenge. Great compostion and fine detail....thanks for minimalizing the gore. I appreciate it!', '2004-09-25 13:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(925959, 106968, 16636, '<td valign="top">turning your image to b/w would have made for a more emotive image</td>', 'turning your image to b/w would have made for a more emotive image', '2004-09-25 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(925961, 105694, 16636, '<td valign="top">a good composition and I like the image darkness which adds a lot of mystery</td>', 'a good composition and I like the image darkness which adds a lot of mystery', '2004-09-25 14:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(925969, 106502, 16636, '<td valign="top">nicely composed but would have liked to see a slightly sharper image, especially in the little one''s face</td>', 'nicely composed but would have liked to see a slightly sharper image, especially in the little one''s face', '2004-09-25 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(925975, 106700, 22970, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going but IMO it does not meet the challenge. Sorry!</td>', 'I see where you were going but IMO it does not meet the challenge. Sorry!', '2004-09-25 14:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(925979, 106001, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very creative</td>', 'Very creative', '2004-09-25 14:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(925984, 106329, 22970, '<td valign="top">Come on already touch the domino and make them fall [ LOL]. You photography makes me want to knock them down myself. Great job!</td>', 'Come on already touch the domino and make them fall [ LOL]. You photography makes me want to knock them down myself. Great job!', '2004-09-25 14:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(925995, 106660, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think you had a great idea for the touch challenge. IMO your perspective should have been down a little to show more of the keys and fingers. The movement in the photograph is somewhat distracting and spotty.</td>', 'I think you had a great idea for the touch challenge. IMO your perspective should have been down a little to show more of the keys and fingers. The movement in the photograph is somewhat distracting and spotty.', '2004-09-25 15:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(925996, 106950, 22970, '<td valign="top">This photo is so simple but at the same time dramatic, great photo!</td>', 'This photo is so simple but at the same time dramatic, great photo!', '2004-09-25 15:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(926008, 106769, 22964, '<td valign="top">It really hurts. Finger somewhat dark.</td>', 'It really hurts. Finger somewhat dark.', '2004-09-25 15:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(926010, 106965, 22964, '<td valign="top">I can feel the pressure...good</td>', 'I can feel the pressure...good', '2004-09-25 15:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(926013, 106381, 22964, '<td valign="top">Simple and interesting</td>', 'Simple and interesting', '2004-09-25 15:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(926015, 106843, 18722, '<td valign="top">Stopping the motion of the water makes it look like ice -- I don''t think that is quite the sensation you were wanting to convey.   But it is a sensation. :)</td>', 'Stopping the motion of the water makes it look like ice -- I don''t think that is quite the sensation you were wanting to convey.   But it is a sensation. :)', '2004-09-25 15:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(926021, 106913, 18722, '<td valign="top">The smoothness of the mirror and the symbolism of getting in touch with yourself make this work well -- but it would have been better without the watch and band.</td>', 'The smoothness of the mirror and the symbolism of getting in touch with yourself make this work well -- but it would have been better without the watch and band.', '2004-09-25 15:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(926025, 106306, 18722, '<td valign="top">There is a tutorial (under Learn at the top of the page) on preparing your photos for submission that covers the sizing problem you have likely heard much about in your comments.</td>', 'There is a tutorial (under Learn at the top of the page) on preparing your photos for submission that covers the sizing problem you have likely heard much about in your comments.', '2004-09-25 15:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(926027, 106493, 18722, '<td valign="top">Needs greater separation from the black background.  Catching the blur of a strummed string might have helped as well.</td>', 'Needs greater separation from the black background.  Catching the blur of a strummed string might have helped as well.', '2004-09-25 15:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(926031, 106016, 18722, '<td valign="top">The effect works well, but there is (imo) too much lost to the darkness -- her left hand comes from nowhere, the flower is floating, etc.  I''m thinking that if you moved slightly to your left the leg would have provided a much stronger diagonal than it does and the balance between light and dark would have been made more equal.  As it is, the negative space on the right (her left) is not being used by the model and is not adding to the image.</td>', 'The effect works well, but there is (imo) too much lost to the darkness -- her left hand comes from nowhere, the flower is floating, etc.  I''m thinking that if you moved slightly to your left the leg would have provided a much stronger diagonal than it does and the balance between light and dark would have been made more equal.  As it is, the negative space on the right (her left) is not being used by the model and is not adding to the image.', '2004-09-25 15:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(926032, 106520, 18722, '<td valign="top">Would have worked much better if the spider were in a more life-like pose.  Believe me, I understand the desire to use a dead one, but I wonder if a pair of tweezers could have been used to place the legs in something other than its death curl.</td>', 'Would have worked much better if the spider were in a more life-like pose.  Believe me, I understand the desire to use a dead one, but I wonder if a pair of tweezers could have been used to place the legs in something other than its death curl.', '2004-09-25 15:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(926068, 106894, 22781, '<td valign="top">I like the color, and I''m not (and I mean, i''m realy not) a "border-lover" bit in this image it realy works. Great job.</td>', 'I like the color, and I''m not (and I mean, i''m realy not) a "border-lover" bit in this image it realy works. Great job.', '2004-09-25 17:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(926069, 105722, 22781, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, I''m realy trying to think about this image to see what you mean...<br/>But I don''t understand (Maybe it''s me thats stupid :-)</td>', 'Hmmmm, I''m realy trying to think about this image to see what you mean...But I don''t understand (Maybe it''s me thats stupid :-)', '2004-09-25 17:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(926078, 106167, 22781, '<td valign="top">Hey hi hello, I like the way you are thinking.<br/>Its a different way than most of the contestants, but I like it.<br/>There is however something you can do to improve your photo.<br/>OK sit tight:<br/>You could improve your focus, its all a bit blurry now, there are also some<br/>Really strong reflections (Flash?) on the bottle and the jewelry.<br/>Some of the jewelry is washed out. So take care f your lighting and your focus.<br/></td>', 'Hey hi hello, I like the way you are thinking.Its a different way than most of the contestants, but I like it.There is however something you can do to improve your photo.OK sit tight:You could improve your focus, its all a bit blurry now, there are also someReally strong reflections (Flash?) on the bottle and the jewelry.Some of the jewelry is washed out. So take care f your lighting and your focus.', '2004-09-25 17:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
