(926590, 105944, 23338, '<td valign="top">My personal preferences are to more literal interpretations of the challenge subjects.  If I had this image without the title, I would have guessed you were saying something about scratchy beards or something.  Nice cropping and focus though.  Also picked up the details in the dark areas pretty well.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'My personal preferences are to more literal interpretations of the challenge subjects.  If I had this image without the title, I would have guessed you were saying something about scratchy beards or something.  Nice cropping and focus though.  Also picked up the details in the dark areas pretty well.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-26 12:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(926591, 106595, 23338, '<td valign="top">Well, I don''t see the "begging", in fact the duck''s back is to us...   Without the title I would have a hard time tieing the image to the subject of the challenge.   In terms of the image itself, I would crop out the top 1/2 inch or so - enough to get red ot the one black reflection in the upper right.  That''ll concentrate the attention more of the duck and the water ripples without any distractions.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, I don''t see the "begging", in fact the duck''s back is to us...   Without the title I would have a hard time tieing the image to the subject of the challenge.   In terms of the image itself, I would crop out the top 1/2 inch or so - enough to get red ot the one black reflection in the upper right.  That''ll concentrate the attention more of the duck and the water ripples without any distractions.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-26 12:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
