(926594, 106821, 23338, '<td valign="top">Wet and soapy?  Yep.  Touch?  I don''t see it.  I personally look for more literal interpretations of the challenge subject.  I do like a couple of the specular highlights up above the gas cap.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Wet and soapy?  Yep.  Touch?  I don''t see it.  I personally look for more literal interpretations of the challenge subject.  I do like a couple of the specular highlights up above the gas cap.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-26 12:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(926595, 105607, 23338, '<td valign="top">What I see is a somewhat jumbled assortment of plant leaves, blossoms and areas of dark and light.  What I don''t see is something that screams out, "Touch".  But, hey, that''s just MY impression.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'What I see is a somewhat jumbled assortment of plant leaves, blossoms and areas of dark and light.  What I don''t see is something that screams out, "Touch".  But, hey, that''s just MY impression.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-26 12:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(926596, 106868, 23338, '<td valign="top">I get the idea: "Good Game" touches.  However, the distance from viewer to subject is such that the translation gets a little lost.  If you could have been a little closer and gotten four or six players with hands slapping, etc., it might have come across a little better.  The distance and the large area covered also contribute to lots of background materials which distract from the message and make it harder to focus on the important details.  Anyway, that''s MY impression only.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I get the idea: "Good Game" touches.  However, the distance from viewer to subject is such that the translation gets a little lost.  If you could have been a little closer and gotten four or six players with hands slapping, etc., it might have come across a little better.  The distance and the large area covered also contribute to lots of background materials which distract from the message and make it harder to focus on the important details.  Anyway, that''s MY impression only.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-09-26 12:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(926613, 105703, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Even better if it''s capturing that moment of contact before the splash.</td>', 'Beautiful. Even better if it''s capturing that moment of contact before the splash.', '2004-09-26 13:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
