(926739, 106198, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fabulous ! What a preciuos photo.  Very well done....looks great in B and W.<br/>10</td>', 'Fabulous ! What a preciuos photo.  Very well done....looks great in B and W.10', '2004-09-26 15:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(926740, 105651, 26518, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the touch here.  Nice photo.  Love the water spraying up in the light against the cityscape.</td>', 'I don''t see the touch here.  Nice photo.  Love the water spraying up in the light against the cityscape.', '2004-09-26 15:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(926742, 106001, 26518, '<td valign="top">Oh I love the imagery!  Very nice!</td>', 'Oh I love the imagery!  Very nice!', '2004-09-26 15:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(926751, 106914, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful portrait, it looks like they could be the same person at different points in their life.  Very pretty ladies also.</td>', 'What a wonderful portrait, it looks like they could be the same person at different points in their life.  Very pretty ladies also.', '2004-09-26 15:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(926752, 106001, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice idea if a little unoriginal. Good setup of the shot but a real shame about the excessive grain. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Nice idea if a little unoriginal. Good setup of the shot but a real shame about the excessive grain. 7 - floyd', '2004-09-26 15:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(926753, 105938, 2798, '<td valign="top">I can''t help it - it really bugs me to see bad spelling in a title like that. Embrace has a c. Even so - a real Finding Nemo moment caught extremely well. Looks like you needed to do a quite a bit of sharpening on it but the results are good. 8 - floyd</td>', 'I can''t help it - it really bugs me to see bad spelling in a title like that. Embrace has a c. Even so - a real Finding Nemo moment caught extremely well. Looks like you needed to do a quite a bit of sharpening on it but the results are good. 8 - floyd', '2004-09-26 15:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(926754, 106961, 10818, '<td valign="top">I really hope this does well, because I love it.  Great abstract feel, cool colors.  Knowing DPC voters sometimes vote low photos of this nature down.....but I think its great.</td>', 'I really hope this does well, because I love it.  Great abstract feel, cool colors.  Knowing DPC voters sometimes vote low photos of this nature down.....but I think its great.', '2004-09-26 15:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(926755, 106283, 2798, '<td valign="top">Hey I bet you already got a bunch of "doesnt fit the challenge" comments. Well I''m ok with fitting the challenge but if you were going for the long exposure, multiple seconds hands shot then you needed a much longer exposure and I think I would have had the seconds hand not starting on top of the hour hand - so it was more visible. A good idea that just needed more care in the setup. 6 - floyd.</td>', 'Hey I bet you already got a bunch of "doesnt fit the challenge" comments. Well I''m ok with fitting the challenge but if you were going for the long exposure, multiple seconds hands shot then you needed a much longer exposure and I think I would have had the seconds hand not starting on top of the hour hand - so it was more visible. A good idea that just needed more care in the setup. 6 - floyd.', '2004-09-26 15:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(926756, 106499, 10818, '<td valign="top">I think I will, thank you.<br/> <br/>Very simple photo that fits the theme very well.  Very nice photo as well.</td>', 'I think I will, thank you. Very simple photo that fits the theme very well.  Very nice photo as well.', '2004-09-26 15:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(926757, 106838, 2798, '<td valign="top">Soft focus and what appears to be a greenish cast (presumably bad white balance) leave this slightly unsatisfying. It is, otherwise, a nice macro shot but the key with macro is usually pin sharp focus. 6 - floyd</td>', 'Soft focus and what appears to be a greenish cast (presumably bad white balance) leave this slightly unsatisfying. It is, otherwise, a nice macro shot but the key with macro is usually pin sharp focus. 6 - floyd', '2004-09-26 15:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(926781, 105722, 8437, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful shot! I would add as one of my favorites, except that in my opinion it does not meet the challenge. I really can''t see the "touch" in it.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful shot! I would add as one of my favorites, except that in my opinion it does not meet the challenge. I really can''t see the "touch" in it.', '2004-09-26 16:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(926782, 105722, 23104, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this has to do with "touch"</td>', 'I wonder what this has to do with "touch"', '2004-09-26 16:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
