(928493, 105938, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I assume you had a hard time between the bright white of the anenome and the dark of the rocks.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice, I assume you had a hard time between the bright white of the anenome and the dark of the rocks.  Good job.', '2004-09-27 21:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(928497, 106714, 3280, '<td valign="top">I think this one had possibilities.  It is just too bright. You can barely see the hand and don''t notice it withoug looking.  Selective DeSat or Black and white may have worked better if you wanted to change the original.  Missed the mark here.</td>', 'I think this one had possibilities.  It is just too bright. You can barely see the hand and don''t notice it withoug looking.  Selective DeSat or Black and white may have worked better if you wanted to change the original.  Missed the mark here.', '2004-09-27 21:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(928498, 106167, 3280, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit off and there seems to be too much fur above the "wealth".  The bottle seems to be tilted toward the right as well.  A bit more saturation on the beeds may have made them stand out more.</td>', 'Focus is a bit off and there seems to be too much fur above the "wealth".  The bottle seems to be tilted toward the right as well.  A bit more saturation on the beeds may have made them stand out more.', '2004-09-27 21:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(928499, 106811, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good idea but a bit too busy.  ONE of the branches against a black or white background with a touch of a finger may have shown better.  This one almost makes me dizzy.</td>', 'Good idea but a bit too busy.  ONE of the branches against a black or white background with a touch of a finger may have shown better.  This one almost makes me dizzy.', '2004-09-27 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(928501, 106961, 3280, '<td valign="top">Colors and background just don''t do anything for me.  Too much tension.  Sorry!</td>', 'Colors and background just don''t do anything for me.  Too much tension.  Sorry!', '2004-09-27 21:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(928502, 106831, 23680, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2004-09-27 21:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(928503, 106766, 3280, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot but there is too much space at the top of it.  A little tighter crop would have worked better.  Excellent focus but the tighter crop would have even taken out the top part that is slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Not a bad shot but there is too much space at the top of it.  A little tighter crop would have worked better.  Excellent focus but the tighter crop would have even taken out the top part that is slightly out of focus.', '2004-09-27 21:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(928504, 106962, 3280, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, a bit too bright, especially the cat.  Too bad you couldn''t get the cat to show some love too!</td>', 'Not a bad shot, a bit too bright, especially the cat.  Too bad you couldn''t get the cat to show some love too!', '2004-09-27 21:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(928508, 105944, 3280, '<td valign="top">I love the crop and the composition, (and of course the smile!).  It seems a bit too contrasty though. Apparently sunlight, it is a little too harsh...blowout of the hat and cheek and a little too dark across the face.  I bet it''s a favorite of the models though as it seem to really show him.  Good job.</td>', 'I love the crop and the composition, (and of course the smile!).  It seems a bit too contrasty though. Apparently sunlight, it is a little too harsh...blowout of the hat and cheek and a little too dark across the face.  I bet it''s a favorite of the models though as it seem to really show him.  Good job.', '2004-09-27 22:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(928510, 106001, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot but wish the the photo could have stood out more.  A little too much shadow on it.  If you could get it to "Jump Out" it would have worked much better.</td>', 'I like this a lot but wish the the photo could have stood out more.  A little too much shadow on it.  If you could get it to "Jump Out" it would have worked much better.', '2004-09-27 22:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(928513, 106965, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done but it seems like it is just missing something.  I can''t put my finger on it. (No pun intended!)  Perhaps more of the arm showing in the mirror or a more colorful background.  Good job however.</td>', 'Very nicely done but it seems like it is just missing something.  I can''t put my finger on it. (No pun intended!)  Perhaps more of the arm showing in the mirror or a more colorful background.  Good job however.', '2004-09-27 22:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(928517, 106817, 3280, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot alot but I''m not sure it was the best entry for this challenge.  Without the title, I would have no idea what it was and I''m still not certain.  A great abstract though.</td>', 'I really like this shot alot but I''m not sure it was the best entry for this challenge.  Without the title, I would have no idea what it was and I''m still not certain.  A great abstract though.', '2004-09-27 22:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(928521, 106237, 3280, '<td valign="top">This was a great idea but the out of focus, grainy, dead center blackberry takes away from the focal point.  A different perspective might have really worked.</td>', 'This was a great idea but the out of focus, grainy, dead center blackberry takes away from the focal point.  A different perspective might have really worked.', '2004-09-27 22:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(928523, 105883, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice job, I like the partial transparency on the hands.</td>', 'Very nice job, I like the partial transparency on the hands.', '2004-09-27 22:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(928525, 106967, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice selective DeSat.  The look on the little face is priceless.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice selective DeSat.  The look on the little face is priceless.  Good job.', '2004-09-27 22:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(928528, 106948, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and focus, I think the splay of the fingers is a bit distracting though.  More of a "caress" may have worked better.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice lighting and focus, I think the splay of the fingers is a bit distracting though.  More of a "caress" may have worked better.  Good job.', '2004-09-27 22:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(928641, 106016, 4877, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo!  I''m expecting a ribbon for this.  10.</td>', 'Brilliant photo!  I''m expecting a ribbon for this.  10.', '2004-09-27 23:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(928642, 106555, 4877, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic image!  You''ve got perfect depth of field, and it evokes a great feeling in the viewer.  Elegant and simple.  Hope you get a ribbon!  10.</td>', 'This is a fantastic image!  You''ve got perfect depth of field, and it evokes a great feeling in the viewer.  Elegant and simple.  Hope you get a ribbon!  10.', '2004-09-27 23:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(928644, 106114, 4877, '<td valign="top">This is a great use of light and shadows.  I like the soft effect you have achieved.  Great feel to the photograph.  Hope you get a ribbon! 10.</td>', 'This is a great use of light and shadows.  I like the soft effect you have achieved.  Great feel to the photograph.  Hope you get a ribbon! 10.', '2004-09-27 23:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(928707, 105825, 15204, '<td valign="top">A beautiful baby!  The lighting is very nice here.  I think a tighter crop would make this better.  Either a vertical crop or, at least, cutting off the plant on the right side.</td>', 'A beautiful baby!  The lighting is very nice here.  I think a tighter crop would make this better.  Either a vertical crop or, at least, cutting off the plant on the right side.', '2004-09-28 00:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
