(928716, 106298, 15204, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  The lighting is great and it makes the one eye so captivating.  THis shot truly draws me in.  10 from me.</td>', 'Awesome!  The lighting is great and it makes the one eye so captivating.  THis shot truly draws me in.  10 from me.', '2004-09-28 00:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
