(928846, 106944, 22046, '<td valign="top">The girl looks sad and the hand seems to be trying to give her comfort. This image conveys emotion and this makes it a strong photo to me.</td>', 'The girl looks sad and the hand seems to be trying to give her comfort. This image conveys emotion and this makes it a strong photo to me.', '2004-09-28 02:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(928848, 106778, 22046, '<td valign="top">What I really like here is the lighter shade of the baby''s feet. This gives the sense of his (or her) delicate skin. I also like the way the mother is cradling the feet in her hands.</td>', 'What I really like here is the lighter shade of the baby''s feet. This gives the sense of his (or her) delicate skin. I also like the way the mother is cradling the feet in her hands.', '2004-09-28 02:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
