(928853, 105648, 22046, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge. I like the graphic design of this and the subtle way that touch is conveyed.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge. I like the graphic design of this and the subtle way that touch is conveyed.', '2004-09-28 02:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(928857, 106824, 22046, '<td valign="top">Such an unusual pairing of models - human and doll. I really like the way you cropped each face. The placement of the hands is great too.</td>', 'Such an unusual pairing of models - human and doll. I really like the way you cropped each face. The placement of the hands is great too.', '2004-09-28 02:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(928870, 105774, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, your model has a natural expression and I like the composition you''ve chosen. Well done, however it doesn''t really say "touch" to me, which is a pity because I like this a lot.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, your model has a natural expression and I like the composition you''ve chosen. Well done, however it doesn''t really say "touch" to me, which is a pity because I like this a lot.', '2004-09-28 03:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(928871, 106827, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good composition and I like the idea as well. I think the sepia toning is a little on the harsh side though, I would have desaturated some of the strength out of it.</td>', 'Good composition and I like the idea as well. I think the sepia toning is a little on the harsh side though, I would have desaturated some of the strength out of it.', '2004-09-28 03:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(928874, 106824, 5728, '<td valign="top">One of my highest scorers for this challenge I gave it a 9, which is good considering I didn''t give any 10''s this time :)  I just love the feel of this image, and the expression on the girl''s face is priceless. The toning is very good as is the lighting. Only something about the crop which I can''t quite put my finger on stops me from scoring this a 10.</td>', 'One of my highest scorers for this challenge I gave it a 9, which is good considering I didn''t give any 10''s this time :)  I just love the feel of this image, and the expression on the girl''s face is priceless. The toning is very good as is the lighting. Only something about the crop which I can''t quite put my finger on stops me from scoring this a 10.', '2004-09-28 03:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(928898, 105651, 26076, '<td valign="top">wow!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'wow!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2004-09-28 06:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(928924, 106093, 26115, '<td valign="top">gr8 photo - seems very hue shifted but thats cool     nice effect   just one thing is that the photo is rather grainy so you may want to address that but overall gr8 photo</td>', 'gr8 photo - seems very hue shifted but thats cool     nice effect   just one thing is that the photo is rather grainy so you may want to address that but overall gr8 photo', '2004-09-28 08:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(928955, 106198, 26321, '<td valign="top">that baby has some beautiful eyes</td>', 'that baby has some beautiful eyes', '2004-09-28 09:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(928975, 106118, 26770, '<td valign="top">Really like the composition and the contrasts in the print</td>', 'Really like the composition and the contrasts in the print', '2004-09-28 10:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(928981, 106869, 26087, '<td valign="top">Good picture.</td>', 'Good picture.', '2004-09-28 11:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(928982, 106198, 4747, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally rate photos of kids (or the family dog) very high, usually they seem like a doting parent and not actually a effort at improving photography skills. This photo captures the moment of wonder and explorative touch.  Although the theme is touch you didn''t just focus in on "touching" to show it.  It''s her face, the fingers and bubbles are secondary and only reinforce the message.  The bubble in front of her face adds depth.  The movement of the bubbles coming towards her caused a slight blur that I don''t feel take away for the image at all. The subject face if beautifully focused and is what makes you "feel touch"<br/>Great interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t normally rate photos of kids (or the family dog) very high, usually they seem like a doting parent and not actually a effort at improving photography skills. This photo captures the moment of wonder and explorative touch.  Although the theme is touch you didn''t just focus in on "touching" to show it.  It''s her face, the fingers and bubbles are secondary and only reinforce the message.  The bubble in front of her face adds depth.  The movement of the bubbles coming towards her caused a slight blur that I don''t feel take away for the image at all. The subject face if beautifully focused and is what makes you "feel touch"Great interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-09-28 11:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(928983, 106926, 4747, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the fingers are in... but I can feel the touch.   Great interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure what the fingers are in... but I can feel the touch.   Great interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-09-28 11:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(928987, 106803, 4747, '<td valign="top">Good photo, one that makes you feel  "touch."  I think if you had cropped the bottom so the the eye was more directed at the hesitation in the baby''s forefinger it would be a little more powerful and the razor stubble on the man''s neck would not be so distracting... all-in-all good interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Good photo, one that makes you feel  "touch."  I think if you had cropped the bottom so the the eye was more directed at the hesitation in the baby''s forefinger it would be a little more powerful and the razor stubble on the man''s neck would not be so distracting... all-in-all good interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-09-28 11:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(928993, 106824, 4747, '<td valign="top">Very freaky interpretation of the challenge. I like it, one of the great things is it gives the viewer to wide room for their own interpretation - I see it as lack of human touch. It''s bizarre and cool, well done</td>', 'Very freaky interpretation of the challenge. I like it, one of the great things is it gives the viewer to wide room for their own interpretation - I see it as lack of human touch. It''s bizarre and cool, well done', '2004-09-28 11:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(928995, 106144, 4747, '<td valign="top">Your focus should be on her touching her belly but your lighting causes the eye to focus on her breast. (Plus it''s a little washed out) I think the photo could be greatly inproved by adjusting the lighting to cause the breast to be secondary and not so obvious.</td>', 'Your focus should be on her touching her belly but your lighting causes the eye to focus on her breast. (Plus it''s a little washed out) I think the photo could be greatly inproved by adjusting the lighting to cause the breast to be secondary and not so obvious.', '2004-09-28 11:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
