(929088, 106849, 4747, '<td valign="top">You have a great concept here, a more interesting box to display or hold the past would add a great deal to the photo. Additionally the hat and things around it are the "in focus" area of the photo, which detracts from the part that should draw the eye... I.E. the hand holding the tattered ribbons  (I gave you a higher score for concept -rather than composition)</td>', 'You have a great concept here, a more interesting box to display or hold the past would add a great deal to the photo. Additionally the hat and things around it are the "in focus" area of the photo, which detracts from the part that should draw the eye... I.E. the hand holding the tattered ribbons  (I gave you a higher score for concept -rather than composition)', '2004-09-28 12:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
