(929124, 105729, 4747, '<td valign="top">Is that a horney-toad? Cool...<br/>I actually think the lizzard''s claw draped over the thumb has more "touch" impact that the child''s hand petting his head, and may have made a more interesting focus.</td>', 'Is that a horney-toad? Cool...I actually think the lizzard''s claw draped over the thumb has more "touch" impact that the child''s hand petting his head, and may have made a more interesting focus.', '2004-09-28 13:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(929128, 106494, 27204, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I''m just wondering if I would like it better with or without the wedding ring.  My first reaction was to remove the ring to give a greater effect of loneliness--that they are desparately searching for someone, anyone.  But after I looked at it a little longer, I think I like it in the shot.  Now it signifies the loneliness that marriage can have.  You can be living with someone and yet still be alone.  Photographs like these are great because you can find a different message in it each time you see it.</td>', 'Good shot.  I''m just wondering if I would like it better with or without the wedding ring.  My first reaction was to remove the ring to give a greater effect of loneliness--that they are desparately searching for someone, anyone.  But after I looked at it a little longer, I think I like it in the shot.  Now it signifies the loneliness that marriage can have.  You can be living with someone and yet still be alone.  Photographs like these are great because you can find a different message in it each time you see it.', '2004-09-28 13:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
