(929557, 106334, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very physical "push and shove for milk" toutch theme that contrasts to the fluffy heart and soul approach to toutching.  I love it.  Like when I get a soft smack at the back of the head due to  a bad joke there is comfort, confidence and love behind it all.  Excellent focus on the subjects with good framing of trees and dead wood in forground.</td>', 'Very physical "push and shove for milk" toutch theme that contrasts to the fluffy heart and soul approach to toutching.  I love it.  Like when I get a soft smack at the back of the head due to  a bad joke there is comfort, confidence and love behind it all.  Excellent focus on the subjects with good framing of trees and dead wood in forground.', '2004-09-28 19:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(929570, 106831, 24511, '<td valign="top">Breaking inhibitions is healthy and I believe we all need to toutch someones nostril at least once in our lifetime.  Bright lighting, stong primairy colors, crisp image with great focus...love the nonverbal eye contact and toutch interaction between man and child.  I gave it a 9 for this challenge but 7 as a stand alone photo.  Not kwowing the individuals I find portraits often personal.  To stare at them I need to vibrate "caramba that is art" and not feel like I''m disturbing someones special moment.  Thanks.</td>', 'Breaking inhibitions is healthy and I believe we all need to toutch someones nostril at least once in our lifetime.  Bright lighting, stong primairy colors, crisp image with great focus...love the nonverbal eye contact and toutch interaction between man and child.  I gave it a 9 for this challenge but 7 as a stand alone photo.  Not kwowing the individuals I find portraits often personal.  To stare at them I need to vibrate "caramba that is art" and not feel like I''m disturbing someones special moment.  Thanks.', '2004-09-28 19:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
