(929884, 106926, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now, this is a very good concept and a very nice composition. I would have considered making two studies...one soft and one sharp and then spend a good deal of time as to which would convey best my message. Approaching the extreme of the dof it is too soft, but halfway it looks real soft and gentle. All that I am saying is that I would not have sharpenned it to this point. Yet, I am bumping image on concept and composition.</td>', 'Now, this is a very good concept and a very nice composition. I would have considered making two studies...one soft and one sharp and then spend a good deal of time as to which would convey best my message. Approaching the extreme of the dof it is too soft, but halfway it looks real soft and gentle. All that I am saying is that I would not have sharpenned it to this point. Yet, I am bumping image on concept and composition.', '2004-09-28 23:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
