(931296, 106824, 21714, '<td valign="top">I guess I am a bit late on the scene. But just wanted to say that in my opinion this is true art. This is wonderful and this image has depth, it has a story and it''s excellent work. Congratulations. I wish you up there with a ribbon. No disrespect to the others, but I think this is the best. This is the type of image that fascinates me. Images that make me think and feel something. You have done a great job and I wish you all the best. xion bows to you.</td>', 'I guess I am a bit late on the scene. But just wanted to say that in my opinion this is true art. This is wonderful and this image has depth, it has a story and it''s excellent work. Congratulations. I wish you up there with a ribbon. No disrespect to the others, but I think this is the best. This is the type of image that fascinates me. Images that make me think and feel something. You have done a great job and I wish you all the best. xion bows to you.', '2004-09-29 17:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
