(936639, 106771, 26045, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments... I''m really new here and honestly I didn''t go out and shoot for this challenge, but I had this photo from the right dates and I figured it made sense! Also, the quality of the photo ain''t so hot, and I knows it... next time I''ll pay more attention heheh. Thanks again to all who commented, and sorry down there that you had bad thoughts about this picture and title... all I saw was love. Cheers, Katy.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments... I''m really new here and honestly I didn''t go out and shoot for this challenge, but I had this photo from the right dates and I figured it made sense! Also, the quality of the photo ain''t so hot, and I knows it... next time I''ll pay more attention heheh. Thanks again to all who commented, and sorry down there that you had bad thoughts about this picture and title... all I saw was love. Cheers, Katy.', '2004-10-02 10:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
