(936871, 106894, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice, emotive entry. I like the muted color and your choice of border works well for this entry. My only suggestions for improvement would be to show more of the hand clutching the bear (to better convey the feeling of security you chose for your title) and perhaps to include slightly more of the bear''s hat as well. Nonetheless a solid entry that I believe should have scored a little higher.</td>', 'Nice, emotive entry. I like the muted color and your choice of border works well for this entry. My only suggestions for improvement would be to show more of the hand clutching the bear (to better convey the feeling of security you chose for your title) and perhaps to include slightly more of the bear''s hat as well. Nonetheless a solid entry that I believe should have scored a little higher.', '2004-10-02 13:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(936920, 106711, 1054, '<td valign="top">Photographs of pets are always a tough sell on DPChallenge, and tend not to score well unless they are done exceptionally well. I believe this photograph is done very well, perhaps my only suggestion would be that I would have like to see this shot with an aperture 1 stop smaller to pick up a little more sharpness on the whiskers.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-02 12:30:58.</i></td>', 'Photographs of pets are always a tough sell on DPChallenge, and tend not to score well unless they are done exceptionally well. I believe this photograph is done very well, perhaps my only suggestion would be that I would have like to see this shot with an aperture 1 stop smaller to pick up a little more sharpness on the whiskers.', '2004-10-02 13:30:45.000000', '2004-10-02 13:30:58.000000', 0),
