(947555, 106699, 93, '<td valign="top">I''m writing this rather late, but I wanted to let you know that I thought that this should *easily* have been in the top 10.. in a perfect world :)  However, I know as well as anyone how a person can get crucified for trying to be different.<br/> <br/>I loved this photo however, and still do.  It''s got a great mood, and the grainy look was perfect.<br/> <br/>Power to the people not afraid to try! :)</td>', 'I''m writing this rather late, but I wanted to let you know that I thought that this should *easily* have been in the top 10.. in a perfect world :)  However, I know as well as anyone how a person can get crucified for trying to be different. I loved this photo however, and still do.  It''s got a great mood, and the grainy look was perfect. Power to the people not afraid to try! :)', '2004-10-07 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
