(955522, 105773, 25183, '<td valign="top">I voted this shot lower becuase I did not realize my attention was supposed to be on the bracelet.  I saw the bracelet, but the football is sucha large piece of the image.  It draws me completely away from the bracelet and I fail to see its purpose in the photo.  I know it''s purpose, NOW.  Just thought I''d give my 2 cents for my lower scoring on this photo.</td>', 'I voted this shot lower becuase I did not realize my attention was supposed to be on the bracelet.  I saw the bracelet, but the football is sucha large piece of the image.  It draws me completely away from the bracelet and I fail to see its purpose in the photo.  I know it''s purpose, NOW.  Just thought I''d give my 2 cents for my lower scoring on this photo.', '2004-10-12 10:08:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(955655, 106601, 27906, '<td valign="top">The challenge was "touch" and buddy you nailed it.  This pic was not as much kinky as funny to me.  I grinned from ear to ear when I saw it.  You feel the touch looking at the pic, lol.  The lighting is very effective.  The facial expression is priceless.  The horizontal image behind you is a little distracting.  Overall great pic!<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-12 11:27:00.</i></td>', 'The challenge was "touch" and buddy you nailed it.  This pic was not as much kinky as funny to me.  I grinned from ear to ear when I saw it.  You feel the touch looking at the pic, lol.  The lighting is very effective.  The facial expression is priceless.  The horizontal image behind you is a little distracting.  Overall great pic!', '2004-10-12 12:23:48.000000', '2004-10-12 12:27:00.000000', 0),
