(1044164, 106595, 23394, '<td valign="top">wow...what a stunning image.  composition, colors, timing, all--you absolutely nailed it!  on the other hand, i can see where you got clobbered by the ''meeting the challenge'' crowd.  this is one of those shots where everybody benefits but you:  we all get to view it and appreciate it, and you get the sacrificial score ;-)  well, don''t despair...just keep shooting and submitting!  as long as it is good work and you don''t let the scoring affect you, you''ll be fine.</td>', 'wow...what a stunning image.  composition, colors, timing, all--you absolutely nailed it!  on the other hand, i can see where you got clobbered by the ''meeting the challenge'' crowd.  this is one of those shots where everybody benefits but you:  we all get to view it and appreciate it, and you get the sacrificial score ;-)  well, don''t despair...just keep shooting and submitting!  as long as it is good work and you don''t let the scoring affect you, you''ll be fine.', '2004-12-02 23:41:56.000000', NULL, 0),
