(1053720, 106502, 70, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this photo so many times and I can''t believe I haven''t commented on it. How lucky you are to have captured this exact moment, the smile and everything. If this is your baby, I hope you have a huge print framed and hanging somewhere. And if it''s not, I hope the parents do!</td>', 'I''ve looked at this photo so many times and I can''t believe I haven''t commented on it. How lucky you are to have captured this exact moment, the smile and everything. If this is your baby, I hope you have a huge print framed and hanging somewhere. And if it''s not, I hope the parents do!', '2004-12-09 01:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1058460, 106198, 30222, '<td valign="top">surely my praise is a repeat but i could not resist to let u know this is such a touching image/makes me wish i had a intense picture from my childhood like this / how times are a changing / think i owe about 8 photographs from my first year untill my 10th / who knows maybe the good thing about it is that it left me with this passion for photography</td>', 'surely my praise is a repeat but i could not resist to let u know this is such a touching image/makes me wish i had a intense picture from my childhood like this / how times are a changing / think i owe about 8 photographs from my first year untill my 10th / who knows maybe the good thing about it is that it left me with this passion for photography', '2004-12-12 17:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
