(2360384, 106824, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - never ran across this one.  This is amazing.  Love the human/doll juxtaposition. VERY cool.</td>', 'Wow - never ran across this one.  This is amazing.  Love the human/doll juxtaposition. VERY cool.', '2006-04-30 00:39:55.000000', NULL, 0),
